  "scope": "Author’s fieldwork, Nanning Weizilu 南寧位子碌 (Appendix B, printed p.28). No speaker biography or collection date supplied. Exact community, not neighbouring Tingzi. Official community name 位子渌 retained as alias.",
  "notation": "Source §1.1 p.2 explicitly defines superscript digits as pitch values. In a substitutive suprafix, digits before superscript hyphen are underlying and unpronounced; after it is the realized tone. Display derives spoken IPA by this explicit rule, preserving original morphological notation in notes and this ledger. Cyrillic ә glyph normalized to IPA ə; ordinary hyphen before suffix removed as morphological boundary, space retained. Aspiration superscript h represented by IPA ʰ.",
